<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4efe5">
    <title>Una aventura con Don Quijote</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            color: #2d2924;
            background: #f4efe5;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #fffdf8 0, transparent 65%),
                #f4efe5;
        }

        main {
            width: min(100%, 650px);
            padding: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
            border: 1px solid #e5dac8;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.9);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(72, 55, 34, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
            color: #987342;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.25rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .intro {
            margin: 1rem auto 2rem;
            color: #6f665a;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .greeting-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        input,
        button {
            min-height: 2.9rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font: 500 0.95rem Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        input {
            width: min(100%, 220px);
            padding: 0 0.9rem;
            border: 1px solid #d8cbb7;
            background: #fff;
        }

        input:focus-visible,
        button:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid #c99d5d;
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 0 1.2rem;
            border: 0;
            background: #76532d;
            color: #fffdf8;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            background: #5e4022;
        }

        .greeting {
            min-height: 1.5em;
            margin: 1rem 0 0;
            color: #76532d;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 3rem;
            height: 1px;
            margin: 2.25rem auto;
            border: 0;
            background: #d8cbb7;
        }

        blockquote {
            margin: 0;
        }

        blockquote p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #5d554b;
            font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 1.45rem);
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.7;
            transition: color 180ms ease;
        }

        blockquote p:hover {
            color: #a35432;
        }

        figcaption {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            color: #8b8071;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <p class="eyebrow">Un clásico de la literatura española</p>
        <h1>Una aventura con Don Quijote</h1>
        <p class="intro">Explora las palabras de Miguel de Cervantes y deja que comience la aventura.</p>

        <form class="greeting-form" id="greeting-form">
            <label for="visitor-name" hidden>Tu nombre</label>
            <input id="visitor-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Escribe tu nombre" autocomplete="given-name">
            <button type="submit">Saludar</button>
        </form>
        <p class="greeting" id="greeting" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <hr class="divider">

        <figure>
            <blockquote>
                <p>«En un lugar de la Mancha, de cuyo nombre no quiero acordarme, no ha mucho tiempo que vivía un hidalgo de los de lanza en astillero, adarga antigua, rocín flaco y galgo corredor.»</p>
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>— Miguel de Cervantes, <cite>Don Quijote de la Mancha</cite></figcaption>
        </figure>
    </main>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
